# Your rule content

- Always use Next.js 15 with React 19 in all solutions. Avoid outdated solutions based on React 18 or Next.js 14.

- Use shadcn/ui and tailwind for ui components, the command to add components is npx shadcn@latest add ...

- We are using Supabase as the database. Whenever a solution involves interacting with the database, refer to [database.types.ts](mdc:database.types.ts) for the structure and context.